            "Até breve!",
            reservation.getGuestName(),
            document.render()
        );

        notificationService.sendEmail(reservation.getGuestEmail(), subject, body);
    }

    @Override
    public void onReservationCancelled(Reservation reservation, boolean wasConfirmed) {
    }
}

